Tables:A table is a structured collection of related data arranged in rows and columns(One table should store one type of information)
For examplega
Users Table -> User information
Products Table -> Product information
Orders Table -> Order information
Payments Table -> Payment information -- Don't mix different types of data in one table

Amazon Table coulms: | User | Product | Price | Payment | Delivery Boy | Review | -> Not like this
Instead, Amazon creates separate tables
